From: Alex Rudenko <alexrudenko@chromium.org>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:17:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/32] Clear DevTools reload script when navigation encounters
 an error

When initiating a page reload via DevTools `Page.reload` with
`scriptToEvaluateOnLoad`, the pending script was previously cleared only
when a server redirect resulted in an origin mismatch. If the navigation
encountered a network or certificate error, the resulting error page
commit was not treated as a server redirect, causing the script to be
retained and evaluated on the error document.

This CL updates `PageHandler::ReadyToCommitNavigation` to check
`navigation_request->DidEncounterError()` in addition to server redirect
origin checks, ensuring the pending script is discarded when a reload
fails to commit normally.

